! X11 colour syntaxes: #rgb keeps the high nibble, rgb:h/h/h scales
*background: #123
*foreground: rgb:f/f/f
*cursorColor: #fedcba987
*color0: #000
*color1: rgb:c/0/0
*color2: rgb:00/cc/00
*color3: #cccc00
*color4: rgb:000/000/ccc
*color5: #c0c
*color6: #00cccc
*color7: rgb:cccc/cccc/cccc
*color8: #666666
*color9: #f00
*color10: rgb:0/f/0
*color11: #ffff00
*color12: #0000ffff0000
*color13: #ff00ff
*color14: #00ffff
*color15: rgb:ff/ff/ff
